            bindings = <
              &kp LS(N1)   &kp RA(N2)   &kp LS(N3)  &kp RA(N4)  &kp LS(N5)     &caret        &kp LS(N6)    &kp RBKT      &kp BSLH    &kp LS(N2)
              &kp LBKT     &trans       &kp RA(S)   &btick      &kp LS(MINUS)  &kp C_MUTE    &kp RA(Y)     &kp LS(N4)    &kp RA(N3)  &kp SEMI
&kp LS(DOT)   &kp RA(F18)  &kp RA(F19)  &trans      &trans      &kp LS(N1)     &kp C_VOL_DN  &kp C_VOL_UP  &kp C_PREV    &kp C_NEXT  &kp LS(RA(N7))  &kp SQT
                                     &trans     &gif       &mo ADJ            &trans        &trans          &kp C_PLAY_PAUSE
